        "id": 39179,
        "name": "TheJayMann",
        "username": "TheJayMann",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/thejaymann/{size}/2261_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-09-24T18:33:50.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>While actions occur in the order the the cards have been played, anything which modifies damage count is considered to always be in effect, and thus is easiest to simply apply them at the point damage is to be dealt.&nbsp; The effect of Null-Point Calibration Unit triggers once damage has been determined to occur (and thus all damage count modifiers that would apply would be applied first), so you would get the&nbsp;3 cold damage reguardless of order of play.</p>",
