        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Thanks for the responses we were certainly overthinking it. Gotta get our head outa all the CCGs and other games with multiple steps in each phase.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>So for final clarification it all goes into effect before the ability is even used? So in effect zeros power should have read something like (gond have card infront of me) &quot;Absolute zero deals himself 3 Cold damage or 0 Fire damage&quot;?</p>",
